    "turn_text": "The inflation issue was front and center certainly and is on the minds of so many Americans every single time we're at the grocery store and paying for gas and all of the other impacts the Federal Reserve Chairman is on the Hill today and again tomorrow for hearings. Did you hear any new ideas or new plans that can make its way to legislation right away that can bring about both parties to bring about some change?",
